        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_smoothsnake.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 7b02fa28-081e-420a-91ae-45726306573c).Image",
        "Description": "Two very important Yakuza members are attending The Dartmoor Garden Show.\r\rAnd we received some interesting intel: both targets have some kind of connection to a former target of yours, Masahiro Hayamoto.\rAfter their leader&apos;s demise, they tried expanding their reach in other areas, seeking to appear innocent and harmless to the public eye.\rIn reality, this is just a front to conceal their current crimes.\r\rOur client, a victim of their past business, hired us to eliminate them.\rGood luck, 47.",
